@ref Interpretation Act s 39(1) (src:376-379) and s 27(5) (src:225)
GIVEN d IS A DATE
      s IS A FUNCTION FROM DATE TO BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DATE
`the last day for laying a regulation made on` d `given the days the body sits` s MEANS
    IF   s d
    THEN d PLUS 15
    ELSE `the sitting day that ends the count after` d `by the sitting test` s `with` 15 `sitting days to count and` 731 `days to try`

-- Whether laying on a day is inside the time.  Sitting on the day made: any day from the next day to the fifteenth day after it
-- (the text names no sitting requirement for the day of laying, so none is added).  Not sitting on the day made: only a day on which
-- the body sits, and no later than the fifteenth sitting day after the day made.
